# Applies only to builds whose context is the repository root (the frontend image).
# Allow-list: the frontend source and the synthetic demo bundle. Everything else, including backend/.env,
# stays out of the build context.
**
!frontend/**
!docs/lovable/demo/demo-bundle.json
!docs/evidence/REAL_WORLD_FIT.md
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/public/demo-bundle.json
